    "name": "NSE — Trading Strategy App",
    "description": "NSE and niftyindices endpoints used by this repo (via nsepython).\n\n**Before any www.nseindia.com API call:** run both requests in folder `0 - Session warm-up` in order so Postman stores cookies.\n\nSymbol mapping: `RELIANCE.NS` → query param `RELIANCE`.",
